0..80 Comment "//! The higher-cells subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
81..157 Comment "//! every source that reads them (`import \"./magma-base.gandr\";`): the magma"
158..234 Comment "//! signature whose two corollas `ua` reads, and the translators its models\'"
235..314 Comment "//! tables are given by — the swap of the booleans, the identity on them, and"
315..389 Comment "//! the identity on the unit\'s one injection. A `ua[n, k]` path is derived"
390..448 Comment "//! degree by degree over the signature\'s matching objects"
